# Leovold, Emissary of Trest: with an opposing Leovold out, a player can't draw more than one card each turn. Both players
# control a Leovold. Bot1 bolts Bot2's Leovold on turn 2, after Bot2's draw step: the trigger "you may draw a card" would
# draw nothing (Bot1's Leovold has used up the turn's draw), and Bot2 is not asked. The Leovold dies and Bot2's hand is
# unchanged. The positive control is the neighbouring scenarios, where the draw is on offer.

